      "title": "The 5-Step Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Step 1 (Discovery): Polls 200+ repos with commits in last 24h; rate-limited via Omnigent token cache",
        "Step 2 (Worktree): Herdr allocates instant tmpfs worktrees sharing local Git objects with zero network cloning",
        "Step 3 (Extraction): Lightweight parsers extract service dependencies, Terraform cloud resources, and code AST",
        "Step 4 (Validation): Validates discovered entities against strict PAM Contract 1.1 metamodel schemas",
        "Step 5 (Ingestion): Executes an atomic Delta Lake MERGE query into Unity Catalog with SCD2 lifecycle tracking"
      ]
    },
