      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Fault Isolation & Safety",
      "items": [
        "Syntax anomalies or parse failures log a non-fatal warning to evidence without halting the enterprise sweep",
        "Linux cgroups cap each worker pane at 512MB RAM, preventing memory starvation",
        "Worktrees reside on ephemeral tmpfs RAM disks and are automatically pruned on exit"
      ]
    },
